  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37781092",
      "title": "Using Midjourney in Discord",
      "sourceHash": "ae8e10a6de8346dd8639d4e28c9a7707cd15ead577887c0c4ccb30f26354b324",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.769,
          "end": 4.62,
          "en": "Midjourney is an AI-powered tool",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.62,
          "end": 6.87,
          "en": "to generate images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.87,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "This is the official website, midjourney.com",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 13.718,
          "en": "but Midjourney isn't an actual web interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.718,
          "end": 16.68,
          "en": "or a tool you can download.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.68,
          "end": 19.139,
          "en": "The features to generate these images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.139,
          "end": 22.923,
          "en": "are only available inside another tool.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.79,
          "end": 25.638,
          "en": "And this other tool, some of you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.638,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "might know already, is Discord.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 32.059,
          "en": "Discord is a chat app actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.059,
          "end": 35.97,
          "en": "which you can download to your desktop or mobile device",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.97,
          "end": 38.85,
          "en": "or which you can use directly in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.85,
          "end": 42.39,
          "en": "And the idea behind Discord is that people can run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.39,
          "end": 46.758,
          "en": "their own servers inside this Discord tool.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.758,
          "end": 49.14,
          "en": "In case you never saw this before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.14,
          "end": 51.93,
          "en": "this is what Discord looks like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 53.28,
          "en": "So here we, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.28,
          "end": 57.21,
          "en": "have our Academind server where people can discuss course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.21,
          "end": 60.787,
          "en": "or non-course related tech topics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.787,
          "end": 64.581,
          "en": "Now the idea is that you run your Discord server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.581,
          "end": 67.2,
          "en": "inside Discord, obviously.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.2,
          "end": 70.11,
          "en": "You can then create different categories",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.11,
          "end": 71.678,
          "en": "like course topics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.678,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "And inside these categories, we have the different channels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 79.074,
          "en": "So the chats where people can text each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.074,
          "end": 81.836,
          "en": "For example, inside our Connect category,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.836,
          "end": 84.21000000000001,
          "en": "we have the introduce yourself channel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.21000000000001,
          "end": 85.668,
          "en": "the general channel, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.668,
          "end": 87.89699999999999,
          "en": "And inside this introduce yourself channel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.89699999999999,
          "end": 89.76599999999999,
          "en": "people can introduce themselves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.76599999999999,
          "end": 92.281,
          "en": "to the community on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.281,
          "end": 93.937,
          "en": "But the main thing you have to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.937,
          "end": 97.41,
          "en": "is that Discord is the tool that you need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.41,
          "end": 100.631,
          "en": "to then access the Midjourney server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.631,
          "end": 103.62,
          "en": "Because to start such a conversation here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.62,
          "end": 106.326,
          "en": "to talk to other people, and in case of Midjourney,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.326,
          "end": 111.326,
          "en": "to create images, you need to be part of a specific server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.28999999999999,
          "end": 115.035,
          "en": "in this case, of the Midjourney server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.035,
          "end": 118.67099999999999,
          "en": "And this brings us back to the Midjourney website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.67099999999999,
          "end": 121.98,
          "en": "Because to use Midjourney, you need to join",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.98,
          "end": 124.771,
          "en": "the Midjourney server on Discord,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.771,
          "end": 127.923,
          "en": "and you can do this by joining the beta down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.974,
          "end": 132.471,
          "en": "In case you don't have a Discord account yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.471,
          "end": 134.42,
          "en": "you have to create one here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.42,
          "end": 136.823,
          "en": "As mentioned, Discord is for free,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.823,
          "end": 141.54,
          "en": "so no additional costs occur when joining Discord.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.54,
          "end": 143.576,
          "en": "Or if you have an account already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.576,
          "end": 145.82999999999998,
          "en": "then you can select this option down here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.82999999999998,
          "end": 147.06,
          "en": "in my case, in German.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.06,
          "end": 150.03,
          "en": "But this should be displayed in your language.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.03,
          "end": 154.083,
          "en": "And now, you can simply log in to your Discord account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.61,
          "end": 156.624,
          "en": "And once you did this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.624,
          "end": 160.5,
          "en": "you are now already on the Midjourney server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.5,
          "end": 164.054,
          "en": "So you should see this boat symbol here to the left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.054,
          "end": 166.214,
          "en": "Select the server, and then by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.214,
          "end": 169.756,
          "en": "you are in the Home chat up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.756,
          "end": 172.922,
          "en": "So these are the prerequisites, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.922,
          "end": 177.449,
          "en": "With this, we can already get started with creating images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.449,
          "end": 181.049,
          "en": "Before we do that though, I'm back on midjourney.com",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.049,
          "end": 185.683,
          "en": "because I quickly want to explore the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.683,
          "end": 188.853,
          "en": "These can be found under Get Started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.932,
          "end": 192.873,
          "en": "And there, we go to the Quick Start Guide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.084,
          "end": 196.421,
          "en": "You can always go to these official docs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 196.421,
          "end": 199.11,
          "en": "in case anything is unclear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.11,
          "end": 202.169,
          "en": "Specifically, I want to explore the subscriptions now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.169,
          "end": 204.723,
          "en": "and there, the subscription plans.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.863,
          "end": 210.863,
          "en": "Because Discord is for free, using Midjourney is not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.089,
          "end": 214.038,
          "en": "So you can just follow along the course now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.038,
          "end": 215.644,
          "en": "by watching the video.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.644,
          "end": 219.09,
          "en": "But if you want to actively create images now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.09,
          "end": 223.484,
          "en": "you have to subscribe to a paid plan to use Midjourney.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.484,
          "end": 226.68,
          "en": "At the point in time when we recorded this video,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.68,
          "end": 229.56,
          "en": "four different plans were available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.56,
          "end": 231.18,
          "en": "The basic plan here is totally sufficient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.18,
          "end": 233.07,
          "en": "to get started, by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.07,
          "end": 235.44,
          "en": "So make sure to check the pricing first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 235.44,
          "end": 239.135,
          "en": "before subscribing to a Midjourney plan.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.135,
          "end": 241.83,
          "en": "If you want to subscribe to a plan though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.83,
          "end": 245.633,
          "en": "you can just go back to the Midjourney Discord server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.633,
          "end": 249.603,
          "en": "And there, just go to one of the newbies channels in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 250.74,
          "end": 252.691,
          "en": "In there, in the message box,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.691,
          "end": 256.362,
          "en": "you add a slash and now subscribe or just sub.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.362,
          "end": 259.908,
          "en": "The command will then be displayed already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 259.908,
          "end": 264.06,
          "en": "By hitting Tab and Enter, a link will be generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 264.06,
          "end": 266.609,
          "en": "that allows you to manage your account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.609,
          "end": 268.743,
          "en": "If we access this link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 270,
          "end": 273.724,
          "en": "you can find an overview of your current subscriptions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 273.724,
          "end": 275.97,
          "en": "As you can see, I am subscribed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 275.97,
          "end": 277.9,
          "en": "to the Standard plan at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 277.9,
          "end": 281.555,
          "en": "Down here, I could switch to the Basic or the Pro plan.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 281.555,
          "end": 283.755,
          "en": "So in here, you can now subscribe to the plan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 283.755,
          "end": 287.567,
          "en": "of your choice if you want to actively follow along.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 287.567,
          "end": 289.95,
          "en": "Otherwise, just watch the video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.95,
          "end": 293.253,
          "en": "and see how Midjourney works in the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        }
